    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d377-a11">

                <pb facs="0434" n="384" sameAs="frus:frus1894/pg384"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 3 in No. 48.—Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Dun to Mr.
                            Abercrombie.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Tokyo</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1893-12-21"><hi rendition="#italic">December 21,
                        1893</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Japanese authorities will not interfere with your taking jurisdiction over Lake.
                    I strongly advise you to do so. I advise you to investigate his case judicially
                    and suggest section 4101, Revised Statutes, as means of enforcing sentence of
                    court if ordered to leave Japan. Wire me if you will take jurisdiction.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Dun.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
